<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n79418" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρέξ-ειμι</span></b>  (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἶμι</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>ibo</i>), <i>pass by</i> or
				<i>alongside of</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν λίμνην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					7.58
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				109
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρὰ τὴν οἰκίαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.754f
				</span></i>
			 : abs., <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				3.14
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				4.92
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				8.62
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				1248
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Sosith.
				2.12
			</span></i> ; <i>emerge</i>, of sun from eclipse, <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Sign.</u>
				10
			</span></i>: c.acc.cogn., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν αὐτὴν ὁδὸν
			π</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				5.12
			</span></i> : freq. of rivers, <i><span class="en">
				Paus.
				4.31.2
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>turn aside</i>, metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ιόντος τοῦ λόγου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>R.</u>
					503a
				</span></i>
			 ; <i>deviate from</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν τάξιν τῆς διδασκαλίας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Paul.Aeg.
					3.45
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>avoid</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὔνομα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Them.
					<u>Or.</u>
					21.246b
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>overstep, transgress</i>, dub.l.in <i><span class="en">
				<u>h.Cer.</u>
				478
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁρμονίαν Διὸς θνατῶν παρεξίασι βουλαί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					551
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.) ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψῆφον τυράννων ἢ κράτη παρέξιμεν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Ant.</u>
					60
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>disregard, neglect</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κακῶς πράττοντά τινα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Socr.
					<u>Ep.</u>
					6.11
				</span></i>
			.</div>
